  "notes": "CONJUGATION (godan -su):\n- Negative: {差|さ}さない\n- Te-form: {差|さ}して\n- Past: {差|さ}した\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive for senses 1 and 3 (takes を). Intransitive for sense 2 (light/color as subject with が).\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{差|さ}している indicates an ongoing state — an umbrella being held up, or light continuing to shine in.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n{差|さ}す is distinct from other さす verbs:\n- {刺|さ}す: to stab, pierce\n- {指|さ}す: to point at, indicate\n- {射|さ}す: to shine (often interchangeable with {差|さ}す for light)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {傘|かさ}を{差|さ}す: put up an umbrella\n- {日|ひ}が{差|さ}す: sunlight shines in\n- {杯|さかずき}を{差|さ}す: pour a cup of sake\n- {赤|あか}みが{差|さ}す: a reddish tinge appears (on face)",
